        "chars": 303,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 21.1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        421,
        1161,
        1203,
        1308
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. Limitation on Agency Expenditures. The Budget appropriations of all agencies shall be expended in accordance with the quarterly allocations and personnel ceilings established pursuant to Section 2 of this Executive Order. The term \"agency\" as used in this Executive Order means any office, administration, department, division, board, bureau, commission, corporation, institution or other unit of government, including without limitation \"covered organizations\" as defined in the New York State Financial Emergency Act for the City of New York, the expenses of which are paid in whole or in part from the City Treasury.",
